      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Letting yourself be less\" means letting go of the exhausting performance of trying to fit into a world that is too big and too indifferent for you. It's not about giving up on *life*, but giving up on the *fight* to be someone you're not, or someone they won't accept. Sometimes, the most powerful act is simply stopping the struggle, allowing the noise to quiet down so you can finally hear what you actually need.",
